# ─── NEVER COMMIT PERSONAL CAREER DATA ───────────────────────────────────────
# This repo ships the METHODOLOGY only. A user's real profile, résumés, digests,
# and application archive are generated LOCALLY by the onboarding skill and must
# stay out of version control. These patterns catch the generated (non-.template)
# personal files if anyone runs the system from inside a clone.

# Filled candidate data (templates end in .template.md and ARE committed)
**/profile.md
**/profile-core.md
**/cover-letter-voice.md
**/jobscan-config.md
**/base-resumes/*.md
!**/base-resumes/README.md
!**/base-resumes/*.template.md

# Worked examples ARE committed (clearly-synthetic, no real personal data)
!examples/**

# Generated user data / archive
Applied Index.md
Considered - Not Pursued.md
/user-data/
**/Job Search Digests/
[0-9]*/                 # numbered application folders
*.docx

# Local Claude / editor / OS noise
.claude/settings.local.json
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log

# ATS pipeline: personal config and caches (ats-feeds.json reveals who you apply to)
plugins/jobscan/scripts/triage-config.json
plugins/jobscan/scripts/employers.json
plugins/jobscan/scripts/ats-feeds.json
plugins/jobscan/scripts/workday-candidates.json
plugins/jobscan/scripts/seen-urls.json
plugins/jobscan/scripts/candidates.json
